{"`include_website_name` is missing the `?`, so ActiveModel::Serializer won't treat it as an include-guard, causing `website_name` to be serialized unconditionally even when `restrict_user_fields?` is true, which can leak the user's website for TL0 users seen by anonymous": 0.5945455431938171, "`website_name` repeatedly reparses the URL (`URI(website.to_s)` is called multiple times) causing repeated work": 0.1786578744649887, "`website_name` uses a broad `rescue nil` which can hide unexpected errors - should rescue `URI::InvalidURIError` specifically for better robustness": 0.2947885990142822, "Host comparison doesn't normalize hosts, which can cause case-sensitivity surprises": 0.2187129706144333}